riends and family every cheesecake  we have a junior starts with this basic  recipe we make crazy things too like red  velvet layer cake cheesecake Devils  which is the strawberry cheesecake  cherry blueberry  right now but I think if you're gonna  try Junior's cheesecake for the first  time you know playing slice is the way  to go out of a big cake because it's  more clean on the inside to experience  the gender in an article this is sort of  how you got to do it now what kind of  pop it's really hard to talk with  cheesecake either guys we've been here  for a really long time and as you can  see the neighborhood's changed people  have come and gone but because it's a  legitimate old-school Brooklyn you know  I think it resonates with people still  today they tell me stories how they got  engaged here they brought their kids  here after graduation it just means a  lot to us to be part of people's lives  in that way and we're just a restaurant  at the end of the day but it's something  that's been in this community for 67  years and so it's just always been part  of my blood it's part of my soul it's  what I love to do I get in the car and  come to work everywhere I'm excited so  I'm a very lucky guy  [Music]
 

